<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">Odessa</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Odessa is a port city on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/black-sea">Black Sea</a> coast of present-day <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ukraine">Ukraine</a>, founded under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/catherine-the-great">Catherine the Great</a> in the 1790s. It grew rapidly as the main outlet for grain grown on the steppe of southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a> and Ukraine. Exports through Odessa underpinned the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russian-empire">Russian Empire</a>'s position as a leading grain exporter.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/odessa.jpg" alt="Odessa" width="320" height="214" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Nata Naval · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%D0%92%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%86%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%81%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%8F%D0%BA_17.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>…economy throughout its existence, with grain from the black-earth belt of Ukraine and southern Russia forming the primary source of both subsistence and export revenue; by the 1890s Russia was among the world's leading grain exporters, shipping vast quantities through the Black Sea ports of <b>Odessa</b> and Novorossiysk.</blockquote><a href="/empire/russian-empire">Russian Empire · Socioeconomy</a></li><li><blockquote>The traditional account had him compose it in April 1898 in <b>Odessa</b>, while he was touring with his father's band.</blockquote><a href="/songs/o-sole-mio">'O sole mio</a></li><li><blockquote>In January 1918 Bolsheviks and their allies seized <b>Odessa</b> after street fighting with forces of the Ukrainian People's Republic.</blockquote><a href="/state/odessa-soviet-republic">Odessa Soviet Republic</a></li></ul></section>
